Hand-forged bronze cowbells, muffled orchestral handbells, scraped bone guacharaca, wool-damped tenor saxophone, open-hole wooden flute (seljefløyte), fretless acoustic upright bass, detuned Fender Rhodes, 1/4-inch reel-to-reel tape loopers.

